        "updatedText": "Updated: Text\n[Stride]-Stride Step-[COST][Choose one or more cards from hand with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater, and discard them], and [Stride] this card on your (VC) from face down.\n[ACT]G Zone:If your vanguard is a grade 3 \"Alter Ego Messiah\", and you did not get an Imaginary Gift this fight, [COST][choose one or more cards from hand with the sum of their grades being 3 or greater, and discard them], and [Stride] this card on your (VC) from face down. Then, [COST][turn a card from G zone with the same card name as this unit face up], and you get two Imaginary Gift:Force.\n[CONT](VC):This unit's \"when attack hits\" effects activate even if the attack did not hit.\n[AUTO](VC):When this unit's attack hits a vanguard, choose one of your opponent's back row rear-guards, lock it, choose up to one locked card, and unlock it."
      }
